# dfe-hyperdx conflict surface - the catalogue of SANCTIONED exceptions.
#
# GOVERNING PRINCIPLE (see CLAUDE.md): MINIMISE what we change in ANYTHING that
# comes from upstream. Upstream HyperDX moves fast enough on its own - we do not
# want to be managing small fry on top of it. Everything we do must work with
# git rerere, and editing a pristine upstream file is an EXCEPTION that must be
# identified, documented (FORK.md) and tooled (listed here).
#
# Every path below is an upstream file we modify in place, so it is permanent
# merge-conflict surface on every upstream sync. Adding a line here is a
# deliberate act - do it in the same commit that documents the delta in FORK.md.
#
# Formatting is NOT a reason to be on this list. If a gate wants an upstream
# file reformatted, exclude the path from the tool (.prettierignore) instead.
# The one unavoidable case: packages/{api,app} run prettier THROUGH eslint
# (eslint-plugin-prettier), and nx runs eslint per package so the repo-root
# .prettierignore is not seen - files there that we already modify stay
# formatted, which costs no new surface.
#
# A TEST FILE is not a reason either. Our assertions go in a dfe/__tests__/
# directory - upstream test files churn harder than almost anything else, and a
# delta there buys a hand-resolve every sync for tests upstream has no stake in.
# The guard WARNS on any test path listed below. The remaining ones are inherited
# and should be migrated out as they are touched.
#
# Format: one path or glob per line, '#' comments, blank lines ignored.
# Checked by .githooks/fork-surface-check.py (pre-commit + CI).
# Derived from: git diff --name-only --diff-filter=M <upstream-merge-base> HEAD
# Baseline merge-base at capture: e2103f78.

# Agent entrypoint. Upstream ships a one-line CLAUDE.md ("@AGENTS.md"); we
# prepend the fork's governing rerere rule above it so it is unmissable at the
# top of every session, and keep their line intact at the bottom. Low churn -
# upstream rarely touches that single line - so rerere replays it cleanly.
CLAUDE.md

# One added line routing yarn.lock to the merge driver - see FORK.md.
.gitattributes

.gitignore
.prettierignore
.prettierrc
LOCAL.md
README.md
